      "widgets_values": [
        "Use ComfyUI 0.42.1 or newer. Native MOSS support was added in 0.42.0; 0.42.1 fixes crashes affecting the MOSS template. Desktop: update the engine for this instance through Manage > Update, then restart. No nightly engine is required.\n\nMOSS regular SFT · separated components\n\nSelect moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors, qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors (CLIP type moss_image), and flux2-vae_small.safetensors in the three loaders.\n\n50 steps, CFG 3, Euler/simple, native shift 5. SLG is omitted for this regular-SFT baseline. No ModelSamplingSD3 override. Prompt Palette controls the connected sampler seed.\n\nFor editable fields: Settings > Power tools > Adjustable Recipe Workspace > Layouts > MOSS. Layout JSON uses centered pixel boxes; match its canvas dimensions.\n\nTurbo AIO has its own example: prompt_palette_moss_turbo_aio.json. Its publisher specifies Load Checkpoint, 8 steps, CFG 1, Euler/simple. Do not use this regular-SFT sampling recipe for Turbo. Guide: MOSS_PROMPTING.md.\n\nGraph wiring and real checkpoint-header detection checked; GPU loading/inference not run here."
      ],
      "title": "MOSS · setup and model variant"
    }
